meta {
  name: 50-org-admin-setup
  seq: 50
}

docs {
  A second organization for the admin console folders (51 to 55), built with the
  routes NodeWarden already serves, so those folders do not depend on what
  `10-organization-member` does to the first one.

  Run it with the folder it prepares, for example
  `npm run test:api -- 50-org-admin-setup 52-org-groups`.

  State after this folder: `adminOrgId`; the owner; the member confirmed
  (`adminMemberMid`); the invitee invited and not accepted
  (`adminInviteeMid`); one collection (`adminCollectionId`).
}
